  "impact": "Payments were unavailable for 160 minutes. 12,400 transactions failed.",
  "stated_cause": "The primary database failed over to a replica that had not finished catching up, so writes were rejected.",
  "contributing_factors": [
    "Failover does not check replica lag before promoting.",
    "Replica lag alerting was disabled during a previous migration and never re-enabled.",
    "The runbook assumed a healthy replica and had no manual promotion path."
